 R←Test_Open_054(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;parms;tempDir;config;expected;success;log;rc;msg
⍝ *** WARNING: want to rename this fn? Keep in mind to rename its folder under "Tests/" as well:
⍝ ***          the test data is located via this function's own name (∆GetTestPath⊃⎕SI).
⍝ Open a project whose LINK section defines "watch" and "forceFilenames", with neither -watch= nor .linkconfig.
⍝ Checks what Link actually uses rather than what ended up in CiderConfig.LINK.
⍝ From 0.46.0 on the LINK section was ignored in this case, and Link used its own defaults.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 'TEMP'#.⎕NS''

 tempDir←∆GetFolderInTempDir⊃⎕SI
 tempDir ⎕NCOPY⍠('Wildcard' 1)('IfExists' 'Replace')⊢(∆GetTestPath⊃⎕SI),'/*'
 'The test project must not have a .linkconfig file'Assert~⎕NEXISTS tempDir,'/APLSource/.linkconfig'

⍝ "watch" must differ from Link's own default ("both" with .NET, otherwise "ns"),
⍝ or the test cannot tell whether the setting got through
 expected←(1+##.Cider.HasDotNet)⊃'none' 'ns'
 config←##.Cider.ReadProjectConfig tempDir
 config.LINK.watch←expected
 config ##.Cider.WriteProjectConfig tempDir

 parms←##.Cider.CreateOpenParms ⍬
 parms.folder←tempDir
 parms.parent←'#.TEMP'
 parms.ignoreUserExec←1
 parms.batch←1
 ##.Cider.C.AddAutomation'YesOrNo' 'ChangeCurrentDir@' 'n'

 (success log)←##.Cider.OpenProject parms
 Assert success
 →T.GoToTidyUp∨/'ERROR'⍷log

 →T.GoToTidyUp expected≢'watch'∆GetLinkOption'#.TEMP.Foo'
 →T.GoToTidyUp 1≢'forceFilenames'∆GetLinkOption'#.TEMP.Foo'

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 ##.Cider.C.Cleanup
 {}(~parms.batch)⎕SE.Cider.CloseProject'#.TEMP.Foo'
 #.⎕EX'TEMP'
 (rc msg)←FilesAndDirs.RmDirByForce tempDir
 msg Assert 0=rc
⍝Done
